{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo features  all of Chapter 1 and the start of Chapter 2 playable (there are 4 Chapters total in the full game). This demo is best played with a mouse. Demo progress carries over to the full game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771090/extras/bomb_throw_300.gif?t=1748559118\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Count of Monte Clicker is a short incremental game based on  the iconic novel 'The Count of Monte Christo' by Alexandre Dumas.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In 'The Count of Monte Clicker' you will become Edmond Dantes, an innocent man imprisoned for life. Along with fellow prisoner and genius Abbe Faria, you must escape the Chateau d'Idle, France's hardest prison. And if the Abbe is not mad, there is an unbelievable treasure buried on the island of Monte Clicker, just waiting to claimed...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn to the ways of the world and become a gentleman under the mentorship of the wise Abbe Faria.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771090/extras/liberty_320.gif?t=1748559118\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your skills, wits and perseverance to overcome the challenges of your escape.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771090/extras/upgrades_300.gif?t=1748559118\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy a  surprising variety of incremental and upgrade-based gameplay.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771090/extras/rapid_chipping_296.gif?t=1748559118\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take part in Dumas' iconic story as it has never been told before.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771090/extras/swimming_400.gif?t=1748559118\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Relaxing, incremental, upgrade-based gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A thrilling and comedic story of escape and friendship.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple game modes across 4 Chapters in the full game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hand-drawn pixel graphics.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rainy lo-fi soundtrack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From Adam Travers, developer of  'Journey to Incrementalia'.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3771090?t=1748559118","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771090/87a761a304acb43c2dff0d6105c86e6cadf0b124/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748559118","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771090/3f12cc03db41ebd55787a96681a6eb6e1ccbf8d4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748559118","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771090/3f12cc03db41ebd55787a96681a6eb6e1ccbf8d4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748559118","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo features  all of Chapter 1 and the start of Chapter 2 playable (there are 4 Chapters total in the full game). This demo is best played with a mouse. Demo progress carries over to the full game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph